'''G1 Climax 2026 Day 17''' was the seventeenth show of the [[G1 Climax 2026]] tournament produced by [[New Okaiken Pro-Wrestling|NOPW]], held on October 7, 2026 at the Toyozawa Municipal Gymnasium in [[Toyozawa]]. The show featured all five [[G1 Climax 2026|Block A]] Round 9 matches — the block's final night.

The night is remembered for the draw that decided the block — [[Leoni Masua]] and [[Kawada Masahiro]] going the full 30:00 in Toyozawa, both men standing at the bell, and [[Marcus Vance|Marcus "The Drill" Vance]] winning the block without wrestling the night anyone will remember.

